  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFPA - The Danish Family Planning Association  - Strategic Partnership 2022-2026 - Humanitarian</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Three strategic priorities permeate across all strategic partnerships in the period. Democratic values and human rights, fragile context and displacement, and climate and green solutions are present through different approaches and varying emphasis in line with the technical capacity and the partner&#x2019;s core competencies.</narrative>
